  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table border=\"0\" style=\"vertical-align:top; border: 3px outset #c8d0d8; width:95%; margin: 1em auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td rowspan=\"2\" style=\"font-variant: small-caps; padding:5px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 100%;\"><center>Hi. I'm Luis, a member of Wikia's <a href=\"http://community.fandom.com/wiki/Community_Team\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Community Team\">community team</a>. </center>\n<ul><li>Looking for help with this wiki? Contact your local admins by visiting Special:ListAdmins</li>\n<li>Need help with using Wikia? Check out our <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Forum:Community_Central_Forum\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:community:Forum:Community Central Forum\">community help forum</a><br /></li>\n<li>Want to keep up with the latest Wikia news? Stop by our <a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Blog:Wikia_Staff_Blog\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:community:Blog:Wikia Staff Blog\">Staff Blog</a><br /></li>\n<li>Got a question for the Wikia Staff? You can send us a message <a href=\"http://community.fandom.com/wiki/Special:Contact\" title=\"Special:Contact\">here</a><br /></li></ul>\n</span></td>\n<td style=\"width:100px; height:100px; border-width:0px;\"><span title=\"Luis\"><img src=\"https://images2.wikia.nocookie.net/central/images/d/d2/Luis.jpg\" alt=\"Luis.jpg\" /></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center; padding:5px;\"><a href=\"https://community.fandom.com/wiki/Project:Staff\" title=\"This user is a member of Fandom Staff\" class=\"staffSigLink\"></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261119200619\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.006 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.011 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 8/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argum